        {
          "text": "Américo Paredes Interviews, 1995",
          "textSize": "heading-two"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "textSize": "heading-two",
          "text": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "This second series of interviews were collected in 1995, at some point after the interview with Américo's brother Lorenzo. Again in the home of Américo Paredes, the interviewer Manuel F. Medrano reviews some of the topics that Dr. Paredes covered in the previous interview session. Another interviewer, Letty, is also present and asks Américo Paredes several questions. In that process, similar information is revisited and new details and topics arise. In the second half of part 3 and most of part 4, there are various photographs positioned on an overhead projector on-screen with the dialogue occurring off-screen. At the end of part 4 and for the majority of part 5 Américo is photographed in his study playing his guitar. "
        }
      ]
